# Line endings, pinned deliberately.
#
# Everything in this repository is *deployed to Linux*: the ops scripts are
# executed by `bash` inside a container or over SSH, and the workflows run on
# ubuntu-latest. A shell script checked out with CRLF does not fail loudly at
# checkout time -- it fails at the worst possible moment with
# `$'\r': command not found`, partway through a deployment.
#
# Relying on each contributor's `core.autocrlf` setting for this is not a plan:
# on Windows it defaults to true, which is exactly the setting that corrupts the
# working copy. `eol=lf` here overrides it in both directions, so the blob and the
# working copy agree on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be normalised.
*.db binary
*.db-wal binary
*.db-shm binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.gz binary
*.zip binary
